\caption{Exploratory follow-up, after the report: the difference between the two prescribed searches, $I = g(\mathrm{D2{+}H3}) - g(\mathrm{D2})$, per rule, its contrasts, the B3 minus R3 gaps $G$ under each family, and the share $S$, pooled over the six fresh markets with equal weights, with paired seed-bootstrap percentile intervals; frozen and doubled searches. $S$ is shown only when the lower bound of the pooled D2+H3 gap exceeds the preset floor. The lower block gives the gaps per market (D2+H3 / D2).}\label{tab:ph-reset}
